{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1320312001:1":{"text":"又一张没见过的新面孔。你也是来讨债的？","source_cn":"又一张没见过的新面孔。你也是来讨债的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x154E1A7C912324B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320312002:1":{"text":"听我一句劝，列夫斯基家已经没有值钱的东西了。要是欠你的不多，就再多宽限他们一段时间吧。","source_cn":"听我一句劝，列夫斯基家已经没有值钱的东西了。要是欠你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48848F89B5CB437","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320312003:1":{"text":"你误会了，我们不是债主！","source_cn":"你误会了，我们不是债主！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x362C1A660C02877E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320312004:1":{"text":"不过你刚才说的……列夫斯基家已经完全还不起债了，是真的吗？","source_cn":"不过你刚才说的……列夫斯基家已经完全还不起债了，是真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA19199ACA9CA18DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320312005:1":{"text":"这还能有假？","source_cn":"这还能有假？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89EDE817BD0F074A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7: